  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">State Admission Programme of Brandenburg for Refugees with Specific Protection Needs from Jordan to Germany 2021-2022</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The German state of Brandenburg implements a humanitarian admission programme for refugees with specific protection needs out of Jordan. The project assists 400 refugees who are aimed to be admitted by Brandenburg. IOM will provide comprehensive activities in supporting the admission process.</narrative>
  </description>
